# Ingestion

## Where rules live

- General standards: [`docs/working_agreement.md`](../../docs/working_agreement.md),
  [`docs/engineering_standards.md`](../../docs/engineering_standards.md) §7
- Stock-specific ingestion contract: [`docs/project_context.md`](../../docs/project_context.md)
- Market registry: [`docs/market_registry.yml`](../../docs/market_registry.yml)

## Rules

- Raw fields only — no derived metrics in Python.
- Read active markets from the registry; never hardcode tickers or markets.
- Write parquet to `storage/raw/{market_code}/`.
- Credentials via `.env` + python-dotenv only.
